OL,3,GNEWSAClub bar shut after reports fans
OL,4,Awere 'abusive' to staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bar at a Surrey football club was
OL,7,Fshut for the side's home game on
OL,8,FSaturday after reports that some fans
OL,9,Fwere "intimidating and abusive" towards
OL,10,Fstaff, said the local authority.
OL,12,FWalton & Hersham FC supporters have
OL,13,Fbeing staging matchday boycotts of the
OL,14,Fbar at Xcel Sports Hub in
OL,15,FWalton-on-Thames, claiming the club
OL,16,Fdoes not get a penny from its takings.
OL,18,FElmbridge Borough Council, which owns
OL,19,Fthe venue, said the current deal covers
OL,20,Fthe team's staffing, maintenance and
OL,21,Fcleaning costs and allows them to hire
OL,22,Fthe pitch at a reduced rate.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
