OL,3,GNEWSAClub bar shut after reports fans
OL,4,Awere 'abusive' to staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FMick Moriarty, chair of the supporters'
OL,7,Fclub, refuted any allegations of bad
OL,8,Fbehaviour, saying they were without
OL,9,F"substance".
